  "sourceBoundContracts": [
    "Independent selected extremes and row counts follow native lcl_InsertPosition; selected-row averaged width/count and cumulative width rounding conserve reference width.",
    "Right border stays on original source before insertion; behind transfers it to last new cell while intermediate right lines clear.",
    "ndtbl owns Doc insertion, DoesUndo and scoped recording suppression. Numeric selected/new starts replace retained column sections and shared positions.",
    "Column redo resolves numeric originals and re-enters Doc InsertCol creating new sections. SaveTable restores independent frame-size attributes without duplicate widths; original owners/live selection survive."
  ],
  "residuals": [
    "Merged/nested/spanned/protected graphs and full native layout/pooling/redline/autoformat/signed arithmetic remain unverified.",
    "Existing retained row redo is unchanged and remains a source-backed follow-up.",
    "Native cursor/frame/full table SaveTable reconstruction lifetimes and independent physical browser cell layout remain partial.",
    "Registered IO/open/save/recovery/settings remain byte-identical; no full module/upstream parity promotion."
  ]
}
